{"type":"text","timestamp":1794364479542,"sessionID":"ses_e37ac4e01ffeXNi8x5cqzCz6dT","part":{"id":"prt_1c875182a001HYVcAVSALWFxzq","messageID":"msg_1c8734d30001hOUrXVcttHPGU7","sessionID":"ses_e37ac4e01ffeXNi8x5cqzCz6dT","type":"text","text":"Now I'll show both auth forms simultaneously (spec says \"registration and sign-in forms\"):","time":{"start":1794364479530,"end":1794364479539}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794364479569,"sessionID":"ses_e37ac4e01ffeXNi8x5cqzCz6dT","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_cd079a53f21141ccae7e59d6","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import { useState } from \"react\";\nimport {\n  login as loginRequest,\n  messageOf,\n  register as registerRequest,\n  type Session,\n} from \"../api\";\n\ninterface Props {\n  onAuth: (session: Session) => void;\n}\n\nexport default function AuthPanel({ onAuth }: Props) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50 px-4 py-10\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl\">\n        <div className=\"mb-6 text-center\">\n          <h1 className=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900\">Link previews</h1>\n          <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">\n            Save links and keep their title, description and image around.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\">\n          <SignInForm onAuth={onAuth} />\n          <RegisterForm onAuth={onAuth} />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction SignInForm({ onAuth }: Props) {\n  const [username, setUsername] = useState(\"\");\n  const [password, setPassword] = useState(\"\");\n  const [busy, setBusy] = useState(false);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n\n  async function submit(event: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    if (busy) return;\n    setBusy(true);\n    setError(null);\n    try {\n      const { token } = await loginRequest(username, password);\n      onAuth({ token, username });\n    } catch (err) {\n      setError(messageOf(err));\n    } finally {\n      setBusy(false);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <section className=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm\">\n      <h2 className=\"mb-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Sign in</h2>\n      <form onSubmit={submit} className=\"space-y-3\">\n        <UsernameField\n          id=\"signin-username\"\n          value={username}\n          onChange={setUsername}\n          autoComplete=\"username\"\n        />\n        <PasswordField\n          id=\"signin-password\"\n          value={password}\n          onChange={setPassword}\n          autoComplete=\"current-password\"\n        />\n        {error && <p className=\"text-sm text-red-600\">{error}</p>}\n        <button\n          type=\"submit\"\n          disabled={busy}\n          className=\"w-full rounded-md bg-sky-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-sky-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\"\n        >\n          {busy ? \"Please wait…\" : \"Sign in\"}\n        </button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction RegisterForm({ onAuth }: Props) {\n  const [username, setUsername] = useState(\"\");\n  const [password, setPassword] = useState(\"\");\n  const [busy, setBusy] = useState(false);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n\n  async function submit(event: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    if (busy) return;\n    setBusy(true);\n    setError(null);\n    try {\n      await registerRequest(username, password);\n      const { token } = await loginRequest(username, password);\n      onAuth({ token, username });\n    } catch (err) {\n      setError(messageOf(err));\n    } finally {\n      setBusy(false);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <section className=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm\">\n      <h2 className=\"mb-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Create account</h2>\n      <form onSubmit={submit} className=\"space-y-3\">\n        <UsernameField\n          id=\"register-username\"\n          value={username}\n          onChange={setUsername}\n          autoComplete=\"username\"\n        />\n        <PasswordField\n          id=\"register-password\"\n          value={password}\n          onChange={setPassword}\n          autoComplete=\"new-password\"\n        />\n        {error && <p className=\"text-sm text-red-600\">{error}</p>}\n        <button\n          type=\"submit\"\n          disabled={busy}\n          className=\"w-full rounded-md bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\"\n        >\n          {busy ? \"Creating…\" : \"Create account\"}\n        </button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction UsernameField({\n  id,\n  value,\n  onChange,\n  autoComplete,\n}: {\n  id: string;\n  value: string;\n  onChange: (value: string) => void;\n  autoComplete: string;\n}) {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <label htmlFor={id} className=\"mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700\">\n        Username\n      </label>\n      <input\n        id={id}\n        value={value}\n        onChange={(event) => onChange(event.target.value)}\n        autoComplete={autoComplete}\n        required\n        className=\"w-full rounded-md border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500\"\n      />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction PasswordField({\n  id,\n  value,\n  onChange,\n  autoComplete,\n}: {\n  id: string;\n  value: string;\n  onChange: (value: string) => void;\n  autoComplete: string;\n}) {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <label htmlFor={id} className=\"mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700\">\n        Password\n      </label>\n      <input\n        id={id}\n        type=\"password\"\n        value={value}\n        onChange={(event) => onChange(event.target.value)}\n        autoComplete={autoComplete}\n        required\n        className=\"w-full rounded-md border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500\"\n      />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/AuthPanel.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/AuthPanel.tsx","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/components/AuthPanel.tsx","time":{"start":1794364479536,"end":1794364479551}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c875182c001s7zUqnnep8VTX2","sessionID":"ses_e37ac4e01ffeXNi8x5cqzCz6dT","messageID":"msg_1c8734d30001hOUrXVcttHPGU7"}}
