{"type":"text","timestamp":1794364792364,"sessionID":"ses_e37ac4e01ffeXNi8x5cqzCz6dT","part":{"id":"prt_1c879de0b0016291yAFGNp1K08","messageID":"msg_1c879384c001syQqAXtrJz1gcD","sessionID":"ses_e37ac4e01ffeXNi8x5cqzCz6dT","type":"text","text":"The app is built and verified. Summary:\n\n**Backend** (Flask + stdlib only — `requirements.txt` unchanged)\n- `backend/app.py` — all routes: register/login (bearer tokens), previews create/list/get/refresh/delete with per-user scoping (404 for other users' previews), pagination `{items, total, page, page_size}` newest-first, JSON 401/404/400/502 errors, plus SPA serving and `GET /api/health`\n- `backend/fetcher.py` — fetches via `urllib` (redirects, `final_url`, `status_code`, 10s timeout, 1.5 MB cap), parses with `HTMLParser`: `og:*` wins over `<title>`/`<meta name=\"description\">`, strips tags/entities, collapses whitespace, resolves relative `og:image`\n- `backend/db.py` — SQLite at `./data/app.db` (WAL, FKs); `backend/security.py` — PBKDF2 passwords + opaque session tokens\n- `backend/requirements.lock` — converted to a plain version-pinning constraints file: the original hash format only works with pip ≥26.1 (verified 25.1.1–26.0 fail), so this now installs cleanly on any pip\n\n**Frontend** (React 19 + TS + Vite 8 + Tailwind 4)\n- Side-by-side sign-in and registration forms; header with username + sign out\n- Add-link input with disabled/`Adding…` loading state\n- Preview cards: image (or placeholder), title, description, host, link to the page, refresh/delete with busy states; Prev/Next paging\n- Tailwind via `@tailwindcss/vite` with only `src/index.css` (`@import \"tailwindcss\"`); `npm run build` runs `tsc --noEmit` first\n\n**Verified**: 77-check end-to-end suite against a local fixture server (auth, isolation, OG/fallback/entity extraction, redirects, 404-page previews, pagination, refresh/delete, error cases) — all passing; `npm ci && npm run build` clean; data survives a server restart; fresh-start smoke test passes.","time":{"start":1794364792331,"end":1794364792335}}}
